


                         File Converter Utility
                           by James Lampert


File Converter is a utility program for converting files from one format to
another.  For example, it can convert a mailmerge file, saved from
MaxiPlan, to the format used in WordPerfect, or to that used by Kind
Words.  This program is written in AmigaBasic, and is supplied without any
read protection whatsoever, so you can examine and modify it at will.
It expects to find AmigaBasic on the root directory of a disk called
"Extras," and will ask for such a disk if it cannot find one in a drive.

For more information, click on File Converter.Help.


